    <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://www.thecocktaildb.com/api/json/v1/1/lookup.php?i=17248"/>
    <drink:preparation>Add ice to a shaker and pour in all ingredients.
Using a bar spoon, stir 40 to 45 revolutions or until thoroughly chilled.
Strain into a martini glass or over ice into a rocks glass. Garnish with orange twist.</drink:preparation>
    <schema:description>Add ice to a shaker and pour in all ingredients.
Using a bar spoon, stir 40 to 45 revolutions or until thoroughly chilled.
Strain into a martini glass or over ice into a rocks glass. Garnish with orange twist.</schema:description>
