  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/cocktail/halloween-punch">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/onto#Cocktail"/>
    <rdfs:label>Halloween Punch</rdfs:label>
    <schema:name>Halloween Punch</schema:name>
    <dcterms:identifier>178313</dcterms:identifier>
    <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://www.thecocktaildb.com/api/json/v1/1/lookup.php?i=178313"/>
    <drink:preparation>Tip the cherry juice, orange peel, chilli, cinnamon sticks, cloves and ginger into a large saucepan. Simmer for 5 mins, then turn off the heat. Leave to cool, then chill for at least 4 hrs, or up to 2 days – the longer you leave it the more intense the flavours. If serving to young children, take the chilli out after a few hours.&#13;
&#13;
When you’re ready to serve, pour the juice into a jug. Serve in glass bottles or glasses and pop a straw in each. If you're adding vodka, do so at this stage. Dangle a fangs sweet from each glass.</drink:preparation>
    <schema:description>Tip the cherry juice, orange peel, chilli, cinnamon sticks, cloves and ginger into a large saucepan. Simmer for 5 mins, then turn off the heat. Leave to cool, then chill for at least 4 hrs, or up to 2 days – the longer you leave it the more intense the flavours. If serving to young children, take the chilli out after a few hours.&#13;
&#13;
When you’re ready to serve, pour the juice into a jug. Serve in glass bottles or glasses and pop a straw in each. If you're adding vodka, do so at this stage. Dangle a fangs sweet from each glass.</schema:description>
