  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/id/cocktail/zombie">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://nathantrance.github.io/SemanticWeb/onto#Cocktail"/>
    <rdfs:label>Zombie</rdfs:label>
    <schema:name>Zombie</schema:name>
    <dcterms:identifier>17241</dcterms:identifier>
    <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://www.thecocktaildb.com/api/json/v1/1/lookup.php?i=17241"/>
    <drink:preparation>Blend at high speed for no more than 5 seconds.

Pour into a glass, add ice cubes to fill, then add the garnish.

*Donn’s mix: Bring 3 crushed cinnamon sticks, 1 cup of sugar and 1 cup of water to a boil, stirring until the sugar is dissolved.

Simmer for 2 minutes, then remove from the heat and let sit for at least 2 hours before straining into a clean glass bottle.

Then add 1 part of the syrup and 2 parts of fresh grapefruit juice together.</drink:preparation>
    <schema:description>Blend at high speed for no more than 5 seconds.

Pour into a glass, add ice cubes to fill, then add the garnish.

*Donn’s mix: Bring 3 crushed cinnamon sticks, 1 cup of sugar and 1 cup of water to a boil, stirring until the sugar is dissolved.

Simmer for 2 minutes, then remove from the heat and let sit for at least 2 hours before straining into a clean glass bottle.

Then add 1 part of the syrup and 2 parts of fresh grapefruit juice together.</schema:description>
