    <dcterms:source rdf:resource="https://www.thecocktaildb.com/api/json/v1/1/lookup.php?i=17245"/>
    <drink:preparation>1) Add the Bombay Sapphire, Blue Curacao, rosemary sprig and gently squeezed lemon wedge to a balloon glass. Swirl well to combine.
2) Fill with cubed ice and top with the Fever-Tree Light Tonic Water.
3) Gently fold with a bar spoon to mix.</drink:preparation>
